function enterMusicFocus(id,trigger){const track=tracks[id];if(!track)return;musicReturnFocus=trigger||document.activeElement;musicReturnScroll=scrollY;setMusicPreview(id);lyricsFocusController?.prepare(track);const focus=$('#musicFocus');focus.hidden=false;focus.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');focus.dataset.theme=themeFor(track);const cover=musicCoverFor(track);syncCosmicFocus(track,cover);$('#musicFocusNumber').textContent=`${String(Object.values(tracks).indexOf(track)+1).padStart(2,'0')} / ${String(Object.keys(tracks).length).padStart(2,'0')} · FOCUS`;
$('#musicFocusTitle').innerHTML=track.id==='afterimage'?'AFTER<br>IMAGE':musicTitleMarkup(track);$('#musicFocusGenre').textContent=track.genre;const released=$('#musicFocusReleased'),release=releaseLabel(track);released.hidden=!release;if(release)released.textContent=`RELEASED / ${release}`;else released.textContent='';$('#musicFocusDescription').textContent=track.shortDescription;$('#musicFocusFacts').textContent=`${track.bpm} BPM · ${track.format}`;const focusImage=$('#musicFocusImage');focusImage.onerror=()=>{if(musicSelectedId===track.id)focus.dataset.cosmicExtension='off'};if(cover)focusImage.src=cover;else focusImage.removeAttribute('src');focusImage.alt=`${track.title} のジャケット`;$(' #musicFocusExternal'.trim()).href=track.sunoUrl||'#';$('#musicFocusExternal').hidden=!track.sunoUrl;$('#musicFocusPlayer').hidden=!track.sunoUrl;$('#musicIndex').setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');$('#musicIndex').hidden=true;document.body.classList.add('music-focus-active');syncHeaderUI();requestAnimationFrame(()=>{focus.classList.add('is-open');focus.scrollIntoView({block:'start',behavior:reduce?'instant':'smooth'});$('#musicFocusBack').focus({preventScroll:true})})}
